2026-06-30 13:04:07,497 | AGENT | Legal Agent answered: As Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I have reviewed the client's requirements and constraints, as well as our company's context. We must be aware of several legal risks in this tender, including compliance with GDPR, data sovereignty, and regulatory requirements related to automated decision-making.

To ensure that our proposal complies with all relevant laws and regulations, we will focus on the following key areas: 

Firstly, regarding GDPR compliance, our company is already experienced in handling intra-EU operations, which means we do not need to rely on Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) or adequacy decisions. Our standard legal basis for processing personal data is Article 6(1)(e) of the GDPR, which pertains to the performance of a task in the public interest. 

Secondly, concerning data sovereignty and protection, we will guarantee strict compliance with the General Regulation on Data Protection (GDPR). We ensure that all client data remains the sole property of the contracting authority, and we have measures in place for protecting this data, including encryption and anonymization if necessary.

Thirdly, regarding automated decision-making, our company has a policy of not allowing automated decisions without human validation. This means that any automated processes will require explicit validation by an authorized professional before decisions are made, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements.

Lastly, we must ensure that our subcontractors also comply with these regulations. Given that all our subcontractors must be EU-established and undergo a vetting process that includes checking for exclusion grounds, we can ensure their compliance with the necessary legal standards.

In conclusion, by focusing on GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and regulatory requirements related to automated decision-making, and ensuring that both our company and our subcontractors adhere to these standards, we can submit a proposal that meets all relevant laws and regulations.
